   "text": {
    "en": "Division of Barangay Muzon. - Barangay Muzon in the City of San Jose del Monte, Province of Bulacan is hereby divided into four (4) separate and independent barangays to be known as Barangay Muzon Proper, Barangay Muzon East, Barangay Muzon West and Barangay Muzon South."
   }
  },
